      "writtenOn": "2026-03-02T05:31:49Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The main check is an `in`, which is O(1) for sets. Arguably this should actually be a `frozenset`. Why is it important for the schemes to be deterministic in the error message?",
      "revId": "2c8bb9a3651f83dea98502a3e6b90e1c74b02ac3",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
