        "id": 3388142
      },
      "writtenOn": "2026-03-03T05:28:35Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "It\u0027s best practice so that logs are easily searchable. E.g. If you have a lot of errors you can `| sort| uniq -c` to see the unique counts of each error. This breaks when you have differences that are not related to the actual error.\n\nAlso the list is so short performance is negligible.",
      "parentUuid": "f9bbee45_5c1c4808",
      "revId": "2c8bb9a3651f83dea98502a3e6b90e1c74b02ac3",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
